OL,5,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FMother and daughter Amanda and
OL,7,     FBecci host at Thompson Hall
OL,8,     FRetreat in Norfolk. Their guests
OL,9,     Fare impressed by the stylish
OL,10,     Fshepherd huts, but the DIY
OL,11,     Fbreakfast isn't to everyone's
OL,12,     Ftaste.
OL,13,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,14,     FThe third visit is to The White
OL,15,     FHouse in Swansea, owned by Lloyd
OL,16,     Fand Marta, where guests James and
OL,17,     FJessica have a toilet encounter
OL,18,     Fthey'll never forget...
