OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe final visit is to Jacobs
OL,7,     FPlough in Bicester, Oxfordshire,
OL,8,     Frun by manager Duncan and bar
OL,9,     Fsupervisor Ryan, who like to mix
OL,10,     Fbusiness with banter. But Lloyd
OL,11,     Fand Marta pick the place apart.
OL,12,G2025 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time. After dramatic
OL,16,     Fdiscoveries and frank exchanges,
OL,17,     Fthe payments are revealed and the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
