OL,5,G2300 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FKevin, 57, has fallen off a ladder
OL,7,     Fand landed on a sharp metal bar.
OL,8,     FJohn, 53, has fallen down a flight
OL,9,     Fof steps. Ross, 31, has fallen and
OL,10,     Fhit his head while on a night out.
OL,11,G0005 24 Hours in A&E
OL,12,     FGraham, who's 50, is rushed to
OL,13,     FKing's after having a suspected
OL,14,     Fheart attack. Pat, who's 71, is
OL,15,     Fbrought in after her husband Bill
OL,16,     Ffound her unconscious at home.
OL,17,G0105 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,18,     FAir ambulance teams rush to help
OL,19,     FBill after his car flips over.
OL,20,     FMalcolm, who has had a cardiac
OL,21,     Farrest, is put under emergency
OL,22,     Fanaesthetic on a hospital helipad.
